      },
      "claims": [
        "gp07_sticky_to_weak_ap_v1",
        "gp07_ap_choice_acceptable_v1",
        "gp07_signal_adequate_v1"
      ],
      "limitation": "Reports a weak RSSI (below -75 dBm) on the current AP while another AP is at least 12 dB stronger and the client did not roam for at least 10 minutes. The 12 dB margin follows Apple roaming guidance; both thresholds are uncalibrated simulation heuristics. It does not show why the client stays (missing 802.11k/v/r, driver policy) and differs from excessive roaming."
    }
